A presentation of ${fref("journeys/programming-language-theory/concepts/logical-system.td")}s where ${fref("journeys/programming-language-theory/concepts/inference-rule.td")}s are organized into ${fref("journeys/programming-language-theory/concepts/introduction-rule.td")} and ${fref("journeys/programming-language-theory/concepts/elimination-rule.td")} for each connective, with proofs structured as trees that introduce and discharge assumptions.
